    "updated_at": "2024-11-27T10:11:11Z",
    "body": "From my perspective, a statement like _\"foreign elements can have CDATA sections\"_ is not exhaustive nor exclusive enough. It's similar to saying _\"1 > 0\"_. That wouldn't exclude 2 from also being greater than 0.",
