    "body": "Sure, but coupled with the next paragraph (and other text in that section) it's quite clear though:\r\n\r\n> [Normal elements](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#normal-elements) can have [text](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#syntax-text), [character references](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#syntax-charref), other [elements](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#syntax-elements), and [comments](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#syntax-comments), but the text must not contain the character U+003C LESS-THAN SIGN (<) or an [ambiguous ampersand](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#syntax-ambiguous-ampersand). Some [normal elements](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#normal-elements) also have [yet more restrictions](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#element-restrictions) on what content they are allowed to hold, beyond the restrictions imposed by the content model and those described in this paragraph. Those restrictions are described below.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
